<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 20.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Sept 20.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>					   Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   McIntosh Sec	    11.84   0.76</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	 10.21   0.96</p>
<p> 3   Villa World	     10.19   1.08</p>
<p> 4   Indu Property	   10.11   0.90</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	  9.91   1.03</p>
<p> 6   BT Prop Trust	    9.89   1.65</p>
<p> 7   Colonial Mutual	  9.71   1.09</p>
<p> 8   Central Equity	   9.68   0.93</p>
<p> 9   Centro Prop		9.20   2.12</p>
<p>10   Gandel Retail Tr	 8.97   0.87</p>
<p>11   Aust Tour		  8.82   0.85</p>
<p>12   Gen Prop Tr		8.78   2.29</p>
<p>13   Nth Building Soc	 8.78   2.62</p>
<p>14   Barclays Mirvac	  8.73   1.26</p>
<p>15   Armstrong Retail	 8.67   0.75</p>
